OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1787064556
OL,3,CAverage speed cameras installed on
OL,4,C'dangerous road' to tackle bad driving
OL,6,FWork to install average speed cameras
OL,7,Fon one of the 'most dangerous roads'
OL,8,Fin Hampshire has begun.
OL,10,F12 average speed cameras are currently
OL,11,Fbeing installed across Portsdown Hill,
OL,12,Fbetween Havant and Fareham, to tackle
OL,13,Fspeeding and dangerous driving.
OL,15,FThe cameras are costing more than half
OL,16,Fa million pounds, and have been funded
OL,17,Fby Donna Jones, the Police and Crime
OL,18,FCommissioner for Hampshire and the
OL,19,FIsle of Wight.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
