OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1787064556
OL,3,CAverage speed cameras installed on
OL,4,C'dangerous road' to tackle bad driving
OL,6,F6 cameras were installed overnight on
OL,7,FMonday, whilst the remainder will be
OL,8,Finstalled tonight (Tuesday 18 August).
OL,10,FCalibration works will be completed by
OL,11,Fthe end of the week, with the cameras
OL,12,Fgoing live shortly after.
OL,14,FDonna Jones says they are also a UK
OL,15,Ffirst installation, with the
OL,16,Ftechnology these cameras use differing
OL,17,Ffrom standard deployments in England.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1787064556
OL,3,CAverage speed cameras installed on
OL,4,C'dangerous road' to tackle bad driving
OL,6,FThey were due to be installed earlier
OL,7,Fthis year, but there were
OL,8,Fcomplications getting power to the
OL,9,Fsite.
OL,11,FIn the past five years, more than 60
OL,12,Fpeople have been injured on Portsdown
OL,13,FHill, making it one of the most
OL,14,Fdangerous roads in the county.
OL,16,FFour people have also died in
OL,17,Fincidents on the hill, which the
OL,18,FPolice and Crime Commissioner says has
OL,19,Fto change.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1787064556
OL,3,CAverage speed cameras installed on
OL,4,C'dangerous road' to tackle bad driving
OL,6,FIn a video statement, Donna Jones said
OL,7,Fthe cameras will make a difference.
OL,8,FShe said: "It's Monday evening and I'm
OL,9,Fhere on Portsdown Hill, and the first
OL,10,Fof the average speed cameras are going
OL,11,Fin this evening.
OL,13,F"Six cameras going in tonight, six
OL,14,Fcameras going in tomorrow. By
OL,15,FWednesday, they'll all be done. By the
OL,16,Fend of the week, they'll be calibrated.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1787064556
OL,3,CAverage speed cameras installed on
OL,4,C'dangerous road' to tackle bad driving
OL,6,F"The good news is, this is all being
OL,7,Fpaid for by our Road Safety Fund. That
OL,8,Fmeans the money`the income that I
OL,9,Freceive from people who are paying
OL,10,Ffines for speeding and for road
OL,11,Fcontraventions.
OL,13,F"This is going to make this road so
OL,14,Fmuch safer. Portsdown Hill, going from
OL,15,FHavant all the way through to Fareham
OL,16,Fthrough Cosham in Portsmouth, is one
OL,17,Fof the most dangerous roads in
OL,18,FHampshire and the Isle of Wight.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1787064556
OL,3,CAverage speed cameras installed on
OL,4,C'dangerous road' to tackle bad driving
OL,6,F"The public, told me you wanted me to
OL,7,Fdo something about road safety, bring
OL,8,Fthe speed down, and tackle anti-social
OL,9,Fdriving, and that's what we're doing.
OL,11,F"This is normally a two-year program,
OL,12,Fit's been delivered in just eight
OL,13,Fmonths. And I want to finish by saying
OL,14,Fa massive thank you to Portsmouth City
OL,15,FCouncil, to Hampshire County Council,
OL,16,Fto Colas, to the Hampshire Safer Roads
OL,17,Fteam, and also to Jenoptik."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
